{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出『寺觀類』第十五葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出《孟子》。「官」，猶「司」也，職掌之\n謂。「得」，得其理也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出《妙宗鈔》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又外國用貝，如此土用錢。人以貝供尊者塔前，貝即落地，以示不受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八音者，金、石、絲、竹、匏、土、革、木。諧，和也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《左傳》"}
